DESCRIPTION:Join a juror-led tour of Americana Reimagined\, where contempo
 rary Bay Area artists deconstruct and reinvent the iconic symbols of the n
 ation’s founding era—from patriotic emblems to folk craft traditions. 
 This guided walkthrough moves beyond nostalgia\, offering insider perspect
 ives on how each juried work bridges 250 years of history with urgent pres
 ent-day questions of identity\, belonging\, and cultural memory. Discover 
 how old and new collide in unexpected ways\, as the juror illuminates the 
 surprising juxtapositions\, hidden narratives\, and bold reimaginings that
  transform familiar Americana into something startlingly fresh. Artists wh
 ose work is in the show will be attending to discuss their work. Tour led 
 by Richard Neil #block-909ef2ea519256d15e66 { } #block-909ef2ea519256d15e6
